  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "Videoconference Client Transmitter: on the participant side, describes what the microphone and the camera deliver (the Units of the User Agent acquire them), extracts the Personal Status, and composes the Participant Portable Avatar for the Avatar Videoconference Server; it also gives the server the Speech Object and the Face Object for authentication."
   }
