  "https://mpai.community/kg/vocab#description": [
   {
    "@value": "Text and Speech Translation. Accepts a Speech Object or a Text Object, translates into the language named by the Language Selector, and produces the translated Text Object and Speech Object. Acquisition and delivery are NOT SubAIMs of this Composite AIM: they interact with the user directly, and therefore belong to the User Agent, travelling with it when the User Agent becomes a Remote Client Application. Speech Object Acquisition and Speech Object Delivery remain AIMs in their own right where they capture from or deliver to a source outside the AIF."
   }
  ],
